# Isobar needs no configuration to run: every data source is keyless.
# Copy to .env.local only if you want to override something.

# Optional. Open-Meteo's free API is for non-commercial use. For commercial use, set a
# subscription key and requests go to the `customer-*` hosts instead.
# (Implemented per Open-Meteo's documentation; not exercised in this project's tests.)
# OPEN_METEO_API_KEY=

# Optional. The US National Weather Service asks every client to identify itself with a
# contact in the User-Agent. Set this to your own app name and contact URL or email.
# NWS_USER_AGENT="Isobar weather app (https://github.com/your-name/your-repo)"
